---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Meyer Sound" description="Direct Meyer Sound distributor, Australia. Buy Meyer Sound loudspeakers — Panther, Leopard, LFC2100, UP series. Expert system design, installation, and ongoing support from System Sound.">
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-num">Meyer Sound</div>
      <h1 class="hero-headline" style="font-size:clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 8rem)">Direct<br /><span style="color:var(--gold)">Meyer</span><br />distributor</h1>
      <p class="body-text body-lg" style="margin-top:2rem">Since 1985, System Sound and Meyer Sound have been inseparable names in Australian live audio. We're one of the country's largest Meyer Sound stockists.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="rule"></div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-num">01 / Why Meyer</div>
      <h2 class="section-headline" style="font-size:clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem)">Gold standard<br />in loudspeaker<br />innovation</h2>
      <p class="body-text body-lg">Since the 1970s, Meyer Sound has led the industry with groundbreaking scientific advancements and uncompromising quality. With Meyer Sound, you're choosing unmatched audio excellence, refined over decades of research and expertise.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="rule"></div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-num">02 / Buying with System Sound</div>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div>
          <p class="body-text">When you choose Meyer for your venue, you're not just upgrading — you're entering a new league of quality where even your highest expectations are surpassed. With System Sound's expert advice and meticulous planning, you're backed by one of Australia's most prolific sound engineering firms.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="body-text">When you buy directly from System Sound, you gain ongoing support and expertise to keep your Meyer Sound system performing at its best — guaranteeing your satisfaction well beyond installation day. We provide system installation, tuning, service, and advice on the best products for your needs.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="rule"></div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-num">03 / Systems</div>
      <div class="card-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr))">
        <div class="card"><span class="card-num">PANTHER</span><h4 class="card-title">Large-Format Line Array</h4><p class="card-desc">Flagship for major theatre and concert touring. Unmatched clarity and power.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><span class="card-num">LEOPARD</span><h4 class="card-title">Compact Line Array</h4><p class="card-desc">Ideal for theatre, mid-size venues, and installations. The workhorse of modern productions.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><span class="card-num">LFC2100</span><h4 class="card-title">Low-Frequency Control</h4><p class="card-desc">High-power subwoofer. Unmatched bass clarity and impact.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><span class="card-num">UP-4slim</span><h4 class="card-title">Ultra-Compact</h4><p class="card-desc">Perfect for front-fill, under-balcony, and delay applications.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><span class="card-num">UPA</span><h4 class="card-title">Classic Point-Source</h4><p class="card-desc">The speaker that started it all in 1985. Still a workhorse.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><span class="card-num">GALAXY</span><h4 class="card-title">Networked Management</h4><p class="card-desc">The processor behind the system. Galileo GALAXY platform.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="rule"></div>

  <section class="cta-block">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-num">04 / Invest</div>
      <h2 class="display-md">Ready for<br />Meyer Sound?</h2>
      <p class="body-text" style="margin:0 auto 2.5rem">Talk to us about your venue, budget, and ambitions. We'll help spec the right system.</p>
      <a href="/sales-enquiry-request" class="btn btn-primary">Request a consultation</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
